   - Dropper Wear: Current-carrying flexible droppers must be renewed if cross-sectional wear exceeds 20-25%.
   - Power Block / Permit-To-Work (PTW): Sectioning & isolation of 25kV OHE, PTW signed between TRD Traction Foreman and Traction Power Controller (TPC). Mandatory tree trimming clearance: 4.0 m from live 25kV conductors.

4. G&SR (General and Subsidiary Rules):
   - Rule 3.62 & 15.09: Emergency Track Obstruction Protection. In case of rail fracture or obstruction: immediately exhibit danger hand signal; place 1 detonator at 600 m, and 3 detonators at 1200 m spaced 10 m apart.
